&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current undergraduate and master students or early career professionals with high potential such as from consulting or investment banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for solving problems derived from data-driven thinking and user needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A futurist who can collaboratively lead a team to build towards a vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated, curious, and adaptable individuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, analytical, and first principles problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership potential and eagerness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker able to breakdown and organize problems, assess opportunity areas, and develop big ideas and priorities to move the business forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial instinct - you think in terms of retained users and revenue, not just engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong bias to action and hunger to move fast and flexibly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background a big plus such as being able to pull data with SQL and read code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
