&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kikoff: The Fintech Powering Financial Security at Scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kikoff is a profitable, pre-IPO fintech company on a mission to empower everyone to achieve financial security. With record revenue growth in 2025 and a unicorn valuation, we&#39;ve built a suite of products that help millions of people build credit, access liquidity, and save money.&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re scaling fast. Join us if you want to build something meaningful and help millions of people move forward financially.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Kikoff:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a consumer fintech startup, and you will be working with serial entrepreneurs who have built strong consumer brands and innovative products. We value extreme ownership, clear communication, a strong sense of craftsmanship, and the desire to create lasting work and work relationships. Yes, you can build an exciting business AND have real-life real-customer impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Director of FP&amp;amp;A, you will report to the CFO and serve as a key financial thought partner to Kikoff&#39;s leadership team as the company continues its significant and profitable growth. You will own the company&#39;s financial planning, forecasting, and analysis functions, translating complex business dynamics into actionable financial insight that drives strategic decision-making. You will work closely with the CFO and cross-functional leaders to build the financial infrastructure, analytical frameworks, and planning processes that a late-stage fintech company demands. The ideal candidate combines rigorous financial analysis with strong business instincts, an AI-first mindset, and the ability to influence senior stakeholders with clarity and confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director of FP&amp;amp;A will initially manage a team of 3–4, with the opportunity to grow the function as Kikoff&#39;s business continues to scale. This role is based in our San Francisco office (in office three days a week).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team that oversees all aspects of FP&amp;amp;A at Kikoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Kikoff&#39;s annual operating budget, quarterly plans, weekly and daily forecasts, and long-range financial model, ensuring they reflect business realities and support strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present executive and board-level reporting packages, including the monthly financial package, board decks, KPI dashboards, and forward-looking commentary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, develop, and grow a high-performing FP&amp;amp;A team, setting a high bar for analytical rigor, business judgment, communication, and cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the use of AI across FP&amp;amp;A workflows to automate routine work and speed up analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted financial partner to business leaders across marketing, product, engineering, risk, and operations — translating financial data into clear guidance and actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Corporate Controller and Accounting team to ensure alignment between financial reporting and operational forecasts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define the company’s key metrics and drive alignment and adoption in close partnership with our Data team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain financial models that capture unit economics, customer acquisition and retention, cohort dynamics, and revenue drivers specific to Kikoff&#39;s businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead scenario planning and sensitivity analysis to support strategic initiatives, new product launches, and capital allocation decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the selection and development of Kikoff&#39;s planning systems and financial infrastructure, driving adoption of best-in-class tools and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support fundraising, investor relations, and M&amp;amp;A processes as needed, including preparation of investor materials and financial due diligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A, investment banking, or a related financial discipline, with significant operating experience at a high-growth company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at a late-stage or public fintech, e-commerce, marketplace, or internet company with high transaction volumes preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of financial leadership at a late-stage private or newly public company strongly valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-first mindset with a track record of driving cross-functional adoption of AI tools in financial analysis and planning workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern planning systems: Adaptive Planning, Anaplan, or comparable tools; ability to own the roadmap and optimization of Kikoff&#39;s planning infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate complex financial analysis into clear, compelling narratives for executive and board audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert financial modeler with deep experience building driver-based models that capture unit economics, cohort behavior, and multi-product revenue dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating as a player-coach - willing to roll up your sleeves on detailed analysis and models while managing and developing a growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, intellectual curiosity, and a track record of building credibility and trust with senior cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Medical, dental, vision — Kikoff covers the full cost for employees, 50% for dependents&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 Meaningful equity in the form of RSU&#39;s&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏝️ 20 days of paid time off per year — we encourage taking real time away to recharge and do your best work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💵 401(k) plan with an employer match to help you invest in your future&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Competitive pay based on experience consisting of base + equity + benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
