&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Frontend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape the future of our &lt;strong&gt;flagship credit building product&lt;/strong&gt; — the engine behind our mission to help millions of Americans build and strengthen their credit.&lt;/p&gt;
