&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kikoff: The Fintech Powering Financial Security at Scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kikoff is a profitable, pre-IPO fintech company on a mission to empower everyone to achieve financial security. With record revenue growth in 2025 and a unicorn valuation, we&#39;ve built a suite of products that help millions of people build credit, access liquidity, and save money.&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re scaling fast. Join us if you want to build something meaningful and help millions of people move forward financially.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Kikoff:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a consumer fintech startup, and you will be working with serial entrepreneurs who have built strong consumer brands and innovative products. We value extreme ownership, clear communication, a strong sense of craftsmanship, and the desire to create lasting work and work relationships. Yes, you can build an exciting business AND have real-life real-customer impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Frontend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to raise the technical bar for our &lt;strong&gt;company-wide web product surfaces&lt;/strong&gt;, spanning Kikoff, Grant, and the products we build next, all in service of our mission to help millions of Americans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role goes beyond shipping features. You&#39;ll own the health, performance, and architecture of the frontend systems that serve our traffic at scale every day. You&#39;ll set technical direction, drive the frontend infrastructure roadmap, and treat performance as a product feature. Like everyone here, you&#39;ll work hand-in-hand with PMs, designers, data scientists, and other engineers to make sure what we ship is fast, reliable, and moves the needle in a meaningful, measurable way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical strategy and architecture of Kikoff&#39;s company-wide web frontend across Kikoff, Grant, and future products, including component systems, state management, rendering strategy, routing, and build/deploy pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own performance tuning for our highest-traffic surfaces: instrumentation, performance budgets, profiling, and optimization of Core Web Vitals, load times, and runtime responsiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead frontend infrastructure work (tooling, CI/CD, observability, monitoring, testing, developer experience) so that every engineer can ship high quality, performant UI by default&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve the shared UI components and libraries that product teams build on, and set frontend standards and code review practices across the org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, cross-team projects that measurably improve the reliability, responsiveness, and polish of our product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers across the team and raise the technical bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requirements:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A. / B.S. / M.S. or strong self-taught fundamentals in computer science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of industry experience, with a track record of leading large consumer facing web applications across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating consumer websites at scale, serving hundreds of thousands to millions of users, where performance and reliability directly affect the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on experience with frontend performance tuning: profiling, instrumentation, bundle optimization, rendering performance, caching/CDN strategy, and performance budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning frontend infrastructure: build systems, design systems, observability, testing frameworks, and developer tooling that make other engineers more productive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on and Deep experience with React in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of driving measurable improvements in quality and performance (load times, error rates, test coverage, reliability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence technical direction and get alignment across teams without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze data and distill information for business purposes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to form strong professional bonds with startup-forward coworkers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$307,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$352,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on applying:&lt;/strong&gt; We know great candidates sometimes hold back if they don’t meet every qualification listed. If you’re excited about this role and believe you can do the work, we encourage you to apply. We’re looking for capability and trajectory, not a perfect checklist match.&lt;/p&gt;
